* FD-09  Common-mode rejection
* Spec 3.1.3.2, Fig. 30: AC 1 V common-mode source at VCOM drives both input
* resistors of the FD-01 network.  (Vop + Von)/2 is the input-CM to
* output-CM transfer the spec observes; (Vop - Von) is the CM-to-DM transfer
* (zero for a symmetric design, finite only with mismatch).  AC 10 mHz .. 1 GHz.
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
{{MC_PARAM}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-16 vntol=1e-10
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
IBIAS vdd ibias {{IBIAS}}
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
VI vi vcm DC 0 AC 1
R1 vi inp {{R_NET}}
R2 inp outn {{R_NET}}
R3 vi inn {{R_NET}}
R4 inn outp {{R_NET}}
XDUT vss ibias vdd vcmpin inp inn outp outn {{DUT}}
RVCM_DUT vcm vcmpin 1k
RLP outp vcm {{RL}}
CLP outp 0 {{CL}}
RLN outn vcm {{RL}}
CLN outn 0 {{CL}}
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 50 10m 1G
write {{RAW}} v(outp) v(outn)
.endc
.end
